WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.734
"Are you sure you can help?" Wukong asked the Buddha Maitreya.

2
00:00:07.735 --> 00:00:09.775
[g@"Yellow Brows is powerful.

3
00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:12.833
He captured everyone with a magic cloth.@g]

4
00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:15.922
He trapped me in a pair of cymbals."

5
00:00:15.923 --> 00:00:19.360
[g@"I can defeat Yellow Brows," said Maitreya.

6
00:00:19.361 --> 00:00:21.573
"He used to be my student.@g]

7
00:00:21.574 --> 00:00:26.930
The cloth and cymbals are precious Buddhist treasures that he stole from me."

8
00:00:26.931 --> 00:00:33.683
Wukong gulped. "Sorry, but I, um . . . destroyed the cymbals."

9
00:00:33.684 --> 00:00:36.834
Maitreya smiled. "Don't worry about that.

10
00:00:36.835 --> 00:00:39.507
[g@We must capture Yellow Brows.

11
00:00:39.508 --> 00:00:43.250
I'll tell you my plan."@g]

12
00:00:43.251 --> 00:00:46.905
[g@Wukong stormed up to the monastery door again.

13
00:00:46.906 --> 00:00:49.635
"Yellow Brows!" he shouted.@g]

14
00:00:49.636 --> 00:00:53.334
"Return my friends or I'll smash your entire mountain!"

15
00:00:53.335 --> 00:00:59.231
The door flew open, and Yellow Brows stepped out.

16
00:00:59.232 --> 00:01:02.298
[g@"How dare you threaten me?

17
00:01:02.299 --> 00:01:06.196
Do you know how powerful I am?"@g]

18
00:01:06.197 --> 00:01:09.180
"You're not powerful," said the monkey.

19
00:01:09.181 --> 00:01:12.183
"You just think you are because you have that cloth.

20
00:01:12.184 --> 00:01:16.472
I bet you're too scared to fight me without it."

21
00:01:16.473 --> 00:01:20.348
"I'm not scared of you," said the demon.

22
00:01:20.349 --> 00:01:24.431
He went back inside and came back a moment later.

23
00:01:24.432 --> 00:01:28.762
He was holding a heavy wooden club.

24
00:01:28.763 --> 00:01:33.102
Wukong pulled out his iron bar as the demon rushed toward him.

25
00:01:33.103 --> 00:01:37.328
[i@Wham!@i] Their weapons smashed together again and again.

26
00:01:37.329 --> 00:01:41.627
As he fought the demon, Wukong took small steps backward.

27
00:01:41.628 --> 00:01:49.982
Slowly he moved the fight away from the monastery.

28
00:01:49.983 --> 00:01:54.120
Soon they were fighting in the valley at the bottom of the mountain.

29
00:01:54.121 --> 00:01:59.349
Wukong took another swing at Yellow Brows and then pretended to be scared.

30
00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:02.711
"You are too powerful!" cried the monkey.

31
00:02:02.712 --> 00:02:04.800
[g@"I can't fight you anymore!"

32
00:02:04.801 --> 00:02:07.057
He turned and ran away.@g]

33
00:02:07.058 --> 00:02:10.517
"Hey!" yelled Yellow Brows.

34
00:02:10.518 --> 00:02:12.961
[g@"Get back here, coward!"

35
00:02:12.962 --> 00:02:16.801
The demon ran after Wukong.@g]

36
00:02:16.802 --> 00:02:21.477
The monkey ran through some woods and into a melon field.

37
00:02:21.478 --> 00:02:24.030
[g@Yellow Brows chased him.

38
00:02:24.031 --> 00:02:28.483
"Where are you, Wukong?" he shouted.@g]

39
00:02:28.484 --> 00:02:31.765
[g@Then the demon noticed all the melons.

40
00:02:31.766 --> 00:02:33.765
He licked his lips.@g]

41
00:02:33.766 --> 00:02:38.027
"These melons look delicious," he said to himself.

42
00:02:38.028 --> 00:02:40.284
[g@A farmer was working nearby.

43
00:02:40.285 --> 00:02:42.666
He had a big belly.@g]

44
00:02:42.667 --> 00:02:45.698
[g@"Hey, farmer!" called Yellow Brows.

45
00:02:45.699 --> 00:02:49.079
"Give me one of your melons!"@g]

46
00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:51.994
[g@The farmer put down his rake and smiled.

47
00:02:51.995 --> 00:02:56.120
He walked over to the demon.@g]

48
00:02:56.121 --> 00:02:59.390
"I'll find a nice, ripe melon for you."

49
00:02:59.391 --> 00:03:03.533
The farmer searched the ground.

50
00:03:03.534 --> 00:03:05.968
[g@Finally he held up a ripe melon.

51
00:03:05.969 --> 00:03:07.981
"Here you go!"@g]

52
00:03:07.982 --> 00:03:11.568
Yellow Brows lifted the melon to take a bite.

53
00:03:11.569 --> 00:03:15.243
Suddenly the melon shrank to the size of a berry.

54
00:03:15.244 --> 00:03:19.986
It leaped out of his hand and went right down his throat.

55
00:03:19.987 --> 00:03:21.545
[i@Gulp!@i]

56
00:03:21.546 --> 00:03:23.974
[g@The demon fell to his knees.

57
00:03:23.975 --> 00:03:28.123
"Ugh! What was wrong with that melon?"@g]

58
00:03:28.124 --> 00:03:32.077
Inside the demon, Wukong punched and kicked.

59
00:03:32.078 --> 00:03:35.648
[i@Boomph! Pow! Boomph! Pow!@i]

60
00:03:35.649 --> 00:03:40.019
[g@"Aargh!" cried Yellow Brows.

61
00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:42.640
Then he noticed the farmer was gone.@g]

62
00:03:42.641 --> 00:03:45.830
Instead, Maitreya stood over him.

63
00:03:45.831 --> 00:03:48.093
[g@Maitreya glared at the demon.

64
00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:53.185
"Give me my magic cloth."@g]

65
00:03:53.186 --> 00:03:56.194
"Y-yes, Master."

66
00:03:56.195 --> 00:04:02.222
Yellow Brows pulled the cloth from his robe and handed it to Maitreya.

67
00:04:02.223 --> 00:04:05.974
"You may come out now, Wukong," said Maitreya.

68
00:04:05.975 --> 00:04:09.498
A tiny Wukong leaped from the demon's nose.

69
00:04:09.499 --> 00:04:13.056
Maitreya threw the cloth at Yellow Brows.

70
00:04:13.057 --> 00:04:18.318
It wrapped around the demon and became small.

71
00:04:18.319 --> 00:04:21.293
Maitreya put the bundle into a pocket.

72
00:04:21.294 --> 00:04:26.179
[g@Wukong returned to his normal size.

73
00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:29.015
He and Maitreya went to the monastery.@g]

74
00:04:29.016 --> 00:04:35.307
Maitreya recited a spell, and the cymbals repaired themselves.

75
00:04:35.308 --> 00:04:38.660
[g@He smiled at Wukong. "Good luck!"

76
00:04:38.661 --> 00:04:42.447
Then he vanished.@g]

77
00:04:42.448 --> 00:04:47.190
Wukong untied his companions and the other spirits.

78
00:04:47.191 --> 00:04:52.654
The dragon, the turtle, and the serpent thanked the monkey and flew away.

79
00:04:52.655 --> 00:04:55.410
"Thank you, Wukong," said the Tang Monk.

80
00:04:55.411 --> 00:04:59.394
"I'm sorry for not believing you when you warned us about this place."

81
00:04:59.395 --> 00:05:01.747
[g@Wukong laughed.

82
00:05:01.748 --> 00:05:10.781
"Maybe you'll believe me one of these days, Master!"@g]

83
00:05:10.782 --> 00:05:19.651
The travelers went outside and continued west.

